WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.050
Long ago, the Everwild sang with eight great voices.

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.265
Then, from beneath the roots, crept the Blight.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.524
Kneel, and stay forever.

4
00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:13.721
Breathe. Then strike.

5
00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:59.271
Gather your courage. Your adventure begins now.
